I wouldn't kill the priest.  That is a waste of a perfectly good
co-aligned temple.

Instead, pacify him with the spell charm monster.  An Arc can cast
that, you just need to get the book.  A scroll of taming might also
work, but I'm not sure.  I know for sure Charm Monster works because
I've used it to pacify angry priests.

Then you can keep using the temple and you won't lose protection and
telepathy.

You probably figured this out, but it is not a good idea to hang around
a hostile priest even if the altar is coaligned.  :D



